Downloading plink
>wget https://zzz.bwh.harvard.edu/plink/dist/plink-1.07-x86_64.zip
>unzip plink-1.07-x86_64.zip 

Downloading 1000g data and unzip
>wget https://www.dropbox.com/s/k9ptc4kep9hmvz5/1kg_phase1_all.tar.gz
>tar -xvf 1kg_phase1_all.tar.gz


Removing duplicates to avoid errors
cut -f 2 1kg_phase1/1kh_phase1_all.bim | sort | uniq -d > 1kg_phase1/1.dups

>./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kh_phase1_all  --exclude 1kg_phase1/1.dups --make-bed --out 1kg_phase1/1kh_phase1_filt

Transfer the list of SNPs into the working directory, and change the name of the list in the job submission script plink_job.sge (in first example it is called gwas_snps_new)

Then submit job plink_job.sge 

The output was processed with R script that is called process_plink.R Which should be included in plink_job.sge
The final output is LD.txt




Trying out on one example
plink-1.07-x86_64/plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-snp rs7569716 --ld-window-kb 1000 --noweb --out plink_o.txt 

38219239

plink was throwing an error
>ERROR: Problem reading BIM file, line 38219239
This was exactly on the X chromosome and I can't figure out what the problem is

I downloaded only chromosome 1 and it seemed to have worked
>plink-1.07-x86_64/plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/chr1/1kg_phase1_chr1 --r2 --ld-snp rs648425 --ld-window-kb 1000 --out plink_o.txt 


plink-1.07-x86_64/plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/chr1/1kg_phase1_chr1 --r2 --ld-snp rs648425 --ld-window-kb 1000 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --out plink_test2


./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --ld-snp rs7569716 --ld-window-kb 1000 --noweb --out out/plink_test1 

Trying other rs
./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --ld-snp rs16849553 --noweb --out out/plink_test2 


changing the window size
./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-snp rs16849553 --ld-window-kb 6000 --ld-window 99999 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --noweb --out out/plink_test3


Trying out from list
./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-snp-list mylist.txt --ld-window-kb 6000 --ld-window 99999 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --noweb --out out/plink_test4

./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-snp-list mylist.txt --ld-window-kb 6000 --ld-window 99999 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --noweb --out out/plink_test4

./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_all --r2 --ld-snp-list rs16849553,rs12914385 --ld-window-kb 6000 --ld-window 99999 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --noweb --out out/plink_test4

./plink --bfile 1kg_phase1/1kg_phase1_filt --r2 --ld-snp-list mylist.txt --ld-window-kb 6000 --ld-window 99999 --ld-window-r2 0.6 --noweb --out out/plink_test6 --parallel














